1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,607
AI;DR,

2
00:00:01,607 --> 00:00:04,951
version 0.1.12.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,019
Every day now gets

4
00:00:07,019 --> 00:00:08,041
its own page:

5
00:00:08,041 --> 00:00:09,202
that day's digest,

6
00:00:09,202 --> 00:00:11,687
and every story, ranked.

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,519
One card sums up

8
00:00:13,519 --> 00:00:15,957
the day's top six stories.

9
00:00:15,957 --> 00:00:17,664
It's what leads the email

10
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:19,700
and the Telegram post.

11
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,415
If you're signed in,

12
00:00:21,415 --> 00:00:22,425
you can vote a story

13
00:00:22,425 --> 00:00:23,307
up or down,

14
00:00:23,307 --> 00:00:25,583
and the tally moves its rank.

15
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:27,763
Open any story to see

16
00:00:27,763 --> 00:00:28,912
why it ranks:

17
00:00:28,912 --> 00:00:29,957
its score,

18
00:00:29,957 --> 00:00:30,921
its outlets,

19
00:00:30,921 --> 00:00:32,200
and when it went out.

20
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,006
Vietnamese gets checked by translating

21
00:00:35,006 --> 00:00:35,714
it back,

22
00:00:35,714 --> 00:00:38,700
and tech terms stay in English.

23
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,207
That's 230 commits,

24
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:42,495
17 new sources,

25
00:00:42,495 --> 00:00:43,459
and a fresh run

26
00:00:43,459 --> 00:00:45,200
every 30 minutes.

27
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,054
Read it at aidr.today.
